Package: dnddata
Title: Dataset of D&D characters
Version: 1.0.22.8.23
Authors@R: person("Ogan", "Mancarci", email = "oganmancarci@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Ogan Mancarci
Maintainer: Ogan Mancarci <oganmancarci@gmail.com>
Description: A dataset of D&D characters submitted to
    https://oganm.github.io/printSheetApp and
    https://oganm.github.io/5eInteractiveSheet.
    It is a superset of the dataset previously released under
    oganm/dndstats, with a larger sample size and more data fields.
Depends: R (>= 3.4.4)
License: file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
LazyDataCompression: xz
RoxygenNote: 6.0.1
